      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Columbia University (Columbia; officially Columbia University in the City of New York), established in 1754, is a private Ivy League research university in Upper Manhattan, New York City, often cited as one of the world's most prestigious universities.",
